    <h2>3. Sticky Navbar - Stays on Top</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Sticky - Sticks to top when you scroll */</span><br>
<span class="text">header {</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">position: sticky;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">top: 0; // Stick to very top</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">z-index: 100; // Stay above all content</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">background: #0f172a;</span><br>
<span class="text">}</span><br><br>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Fixed - Also works, but covers content - Sticky is better */</span><br>
<span class="text">header { position: fixed; top: 0; width: 100%; }</span><br>
<span class="text">body { padding-top: 70px; } // Push content down, so header does not cover it</span>
    </code></div>
    <h2>4. Dropdown Menu - Hover to Show</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="attr">class</span>=<span class="val">"dropdown"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="val">"#"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><span class="text">Services ▾</span><span class="tag">&lt;/a&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="attr">class</span>=<span class="val">"dropdown-menu"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="val">"#"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><span class="text">Business Website</span><span class="tag">&lt;/a&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="val">"#"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><span class="text">Online Shop</span><span class="tag">&lt;/a&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;/div&gt;</span><br>
<span class="tag">&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* CSS - Hide menu, show on hover */</span><br>
<span class="text">.dropdown { position: relative; }</span><br>
<span class="text">.dropdown-menu { display: none; position: absolute; top: 100%; left: 0; background: white; }</span><br>
<span class="text">.dropdown:hover .dropdown-menu { display: block; }</span>
    </code></div>
    <h2>5. Hamburger Menu - Mobile Menu</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Desktop - Show links, hide hamburger */</span><br>
<span class="text">.nav-links { display: flex; }</span><br>
<span class="text">.hamburger { display: none; }</span><br><br>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Mobile - Hide links, show hamburger */</span><br>
<span class="text">@media (max-width: 700px) {</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">.nav-links { display: none; }</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">.nav-links.show { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">.hamburger { display: block; }</span><br>
<span class="text">}</span><br><br>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">// JS - Toggle menu on hamburger click</span><br>
<span class="text">function toggleMenu() {</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">document.getElementById("navLinks").classList.toggle("show");</span><br>
<span class="text">}</span>
    </code></div>
    <h2>6. Footer - 3 Columns Pattern</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">&lt;footer&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;div&gt;</span><span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">&lt;!-- Column 1 - About --&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;h3&gt;</span><span class="text">Ali Studio</span><span class="tag">&lt;/h3&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;p&gt;</span><span class="text">We build websites that sell.</span><span class="tag">&lt;/p&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;/div&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;div&gt;</span><span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">&lt;!-- Column 2 - Quick Links --&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;h3&gt;</span><span class="text">Quick Links</span><span class="tag">&lt;/h3&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="val">"/"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><span class="text">Home</span><span class="tag">&lt;/a&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;/div&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;div&gt;</span><span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">&lt;!-- Column 3 - Contact --&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;h3&gt;</span><span class="text">Contact</span><span class="tag">&lt;/h3&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;p&gt;</span><span class="text">📱 +92 300 1234567</span><span class="tag">&lt;/p&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;/div&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="attr">class</span>=<span class="val">"footer-bottom"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><span class="text">© 2026 Ali Studio | Privacy | Terms</span><span class="tag">&lt;/div&gt;</span><br>
<span class="tag">&lt;/footer&gt;</span>
    </code></div>
    <h2>7. Homework - Build a Pro Navbar + Footer</h2>
    <p>In Playground, build a website with:</p>
    <p>1. Sticky navbar - Logo + Home, Services (dropdown with 3 items), About, Contact + Get a Quote button<br>2. Hamburger menu - Works on mobile, toggles links<br>3. Active link - Clicked link turns yellow, others white<br>4. Mega footer - 3 columns (About, Quick Links, Contact) + Bottom bar with © + Privacy + Back to Top button</p>
    <div class="box"><b>Remember:</b> Navbar = Where can I go? | Footer = How to contact + Where is everything? | Sticky = position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100 | Dropdown = Hide menu, show on hover - .dropdown:hover .dropdown-menu { display: block } | Hamburger = Hide links on mobile, show ☰, toggle .show on click | Active link = Add .active class to clicked link | Footer = 3 columns + bottom bar</div>
    <p><b>Next Step:</b> <a href="/lesson45">Lesson 45 - Final Project</a> - Build a complete client website from scratch. Your biggest project yet.</p>
