          <div class="question"><b>Q8. What are footer 3 columns?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="a"> About + Quick Links + Contact</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="b"> Home + Home + Home</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="c"> Only Contact</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="d"> Only About</label></div>
